OL,3,GNEWSAFood price cap and public sector
OL,4,Areform: Five things from the programme
OL,5,Afor government
OL,6,
OL,7,FMSPs are back in Holyrood, and what
OL,8,Fbetter way to start than with a
OL,9,Fprogramme for government?
OL,11,FThis is John Swinney's opportunity to
OL,12,Fspell out his big vision for the next
OL,13,Ffive years ` what does he want to
OL,14,Fachieve? And what laws does he need to
OL,15,Fpass in order to make progress?
OL,17,FThere's a lot of detail in this bit of
OL,18,Fparliamentary procedure. So here's a
OL,19,Ffew key announcements made by the first
OL,20,Fminister.
OL,23,APub: 01-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,423,420,260,160,0,100
